{"2071100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lovely Traps Dungeon", "steam_appid": 2071100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📖 Introduction :</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To your partner : </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   Hello Golem !<br>    <br>Your mission, and you accept it, is to find everything you can about this old fool and his inventions.  <br>We NEED his incredible creations (including his infinite coffee cup) !!! <br><br>   Now GO !   <br><br>The  Concilio Magorum</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hello sadi-- *khof* I mean magic questing friends ! </strong><br><br><strong>In Lovely Traps Dungeon, you will guide our dear golem friend through the mad wizard's mazes and twisted contraptions in an attempt to recover his immense knowledge ! 🧙‍♂️</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >P.S : Golems are just moulded clay so don't worry about petty things like pulverisation...​   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😈✒️ Game made with love and a bit of madness ❤️‍🔥  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Gameplay :</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  No lives or &quot;continue&quot;. You melted, got compressed, crushed or rolled over ? You will respawn at the last visited checkpoint. At least in story mode. Otherwise : restart !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third person platformer, sometimes sidescroller, with puzzle mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ascent mode tests your platformer skills. Try to reach the secret clouds lab and find the ultimate artefact !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab magic gear to get abilities !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic WASD or ZQSD | left stick controls with mouse or right stick to orient view </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Safe no-fall walk with shif key or X gamepad button</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Mouse wheel or gamepad Up and Down control zoom </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Slide on inclined surfaces, jump from them while keeping momentum !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beauuuutiful graphics ! (or at least we hope so) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If something can be pushed, just move towards it, the golem will handle it </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge death using skills. Unlock them in the challenges room ! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Default one is a &quot;dive&quot; with an invincibility frame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Time attack : there is a timer on top of your screen and a proof screenshot is taken at the end of each level. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can manually make a high definition screenshot. Please first set a key in the Input menu. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    There is often more than one solution </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎚️ Saved games and Screenshots</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By default, on Windows, the files will be put in <br><i>%USERPROFILE%/AppData/Local/LovelyTrapsDungeon/Saved/SaveGames</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to avoid authorisations issues when the game is installed in Program Files.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If on Linux or If launch scripts are used (don't use in program files), in-game and Level End Screenshots are put in</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>[the game folder]/Saved/Screenshots</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💾 Setup and play (Outside of Steam) :   </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    On Windows the LovelyTrapsDungeon(_Demo).bat script   <br>    On Linux the LovelyTrapsDungeon(_Demo).sh script   <br>   <br>A desktop launcher can be created to put on your desktop or anywhere else :   <br>   <br>    On Windows, using the SETUP-CreateDesktopShortcu.bat script   <br>    On Linux, using the SETUP-CreateDesktopShortcu.sh script   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saved games in <i>[the game folder]/Saved/Screenshots</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🖥️ Performances :   </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game  is as optimised as possible, the goal being to run smoothly on my favourite device : the SteamDeck ❣️</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It tries to auto-configures but of course, you can tweak visual settings, key bindings, sensitivity, accessibility options... <br>    <br>    <br>HAVE FUN ! 😋</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you need help, feel free to ask !</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📖 Introduction :</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To your partner : </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   Hello Golem !<br>    <br>Your mission, and you accept it, is to find everything you can about this old fool and his inventions.  <br>We NEED his incredible creations (including his infinite coffee cup) !!! <br><br>   Now GO !   <br><br>The  Concilio Magorum</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hello sadi-- *khof* I mean magic questing friends ! </strong><br><br><strong>In Lovely Traps Dungeon, you will guide our dear golem friend through the mad wizard's mazes and twisted contraptions in an attempt to recover his immense knowledge ! 🧙‍♂️</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >P.S : Golems are just moulded clay so don't worry about petty things like pulverisation...​   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😈✒️ Game made with love and a bit of madness ❤️‍🔥  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Gameplay :</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  No lives or &quot;continue&quot;. You melted, got compressed, crushed or rolled over ? You will respawn at the last visited checkpoint. At least in story mode. Otherwise : restart !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third person platformer, sometimes sidescroller, with puzzle mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ascent mode tests your platformer skills. Try to reach the secret clouds lab and find the ultimate artefact !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab magic gear to get abilities !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic WASD or ZQSD | left stick controls with mouse or right stick to orient view </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Safe no-fall walk with shif key or X gamepad button</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Mouse wheel or gamepad Up and Down control zoom </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Slide on inclined surfaces, jump from them while keeping momentum !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beauuuutiful graphics ! (or at least we hope so) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If something can be pushed, just move towards it, the golem will handle it </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge death using skills. Unlock them in the challenges room ! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Default one is a &quot;dive&quot; with an invincibility frame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Time attack : there is a timer on top of your screen and a proof screenshot is taken at the end of each level. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can manually make a high definition screenshot. Please first set a key in the Input menu. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    There is often more than one solution </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎚️ Saved games and Screenshots</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By default, on Windows, the files will be put in <br><i>%USERPROFILE%/AppData/Local/LovelyTrapsDungeon/Saved/SaveGames</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to avoid authorisations issues when the game is installed in Program Files.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If on Linux or If launch scripts are used (don't use in program files), in-game and Level End Screenshots are put in</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>[the game folder]/Saved/Screenshots</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💾 Setup and play (Outside of Steam) :   </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    On Windows the LovelyTrapsDungeon(_Demo).bat script   <br>    On Linux the LovelyTrapsDungeon(_Demo).sh script   <br>   <br>A desktop launcher can be created to put on your desktop or anywhere else :   <br>   <br>    On Windows, using the SETUP-CreateDesktopShortcu.bat script   <br>    On Linux, using the SETUP-CreateDesktopShortcu.sh script   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saved games in <i>[the game folder]/Saved/Screenshots</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🖥️ Performances :   </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game  is as optimised as possible, the goal being to run smoothly on my favourite device : the SteamDeck ❣️</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It tries to auto-configures but of course, you can tweak visual settings, key bindings, sensitivity, accessibility options... <br>    <br>    <br>HAVE FUN ! 😋</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you need help, feel free to ask !</p>", "short_description": "Guide poor Golem through the Mad Wizard's weird, hard dungeons filled with platforms, traps, enemies and puzzles. Recover lost madn-- knowledge at -ALL- cost ! (golems are just molded clay after all)", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071100/e60647526c174dc496a55403a822e02622b55a5f/header.jpg?t=1785349846", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071100/ccb92d8a7ea182b1b9ee26bb5e4866ff57f7c05a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785349846", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071100/ccb92d8a7ea182b1b9ee26bb5e4866ff57f7c05a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785349846", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4-core Intel or AMD, 2.5 GHz or faster<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Vulkan SM5 compatible, Nvidia GTX1050 +, AMD R9<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 8-core Intel or AMD, 3 GHz or faster<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 2070 or RX6600<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 24.04, Arch Linux, Fedora...<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4-core Intel or AMD, 2.5 GHz or faster<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Vulkan SM5 compatible, Nvidia driver 580 compatible , AMD R9<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Video Drivers : AMD RADV minimum 24.2.8+ and NVIDIA 580+</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Bazzite, CachyOS, Arch Linux, Ubuntu Normal (Not LTS), Fedora... of course SteamOS or any gaming distribution<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 8-core Intel or AMD, 3 GHz or faster<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 2070 or RX6600<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Video Drivers: AMD RADV 25.0.0+ (Mesa 25) and NVIDIA 580+</li></ul>"}, "legal_notice": "Lovely Traps Dungeon, Copyright 2024, Jaufré Aligé. All Rihts Reserved.<br />\r\nLovely Traps Dungeon uses Unreal® Engine. Unreal® is a trademark or registered trademark of Epic Games, Inc. in the United States of America and elsewhere. Unreal® Engine, Copyright 1998 – xxxx, Epic Games, Inc. All rights reserved.", "developers": ["Jau Studio"], "publishers": ["Jau Studio"], "demos": [{"appid": 3017440, "description": ""}], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 799, "final": 799, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$7.99"}, "packages": [739958], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Lovely Traps Dungeon", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 739958, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_savings": 0, "option_text": "Lovely Traps Dungeon - $7.99", "option_description": "", "can_get_free_license": "0", "is_free_license": false, "price_in_cents_with_discount": 799}]}], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": true}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 67, "description": "Camera Comfort"}, {"id": 66, "description": "Color Alternatives"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 69, "description": "Stereo Sound"}, {"id": 70, "description": "Surround Sound"}, {"id": 18, "description": "Partial Controller Support"}, {"id": 23, "description": "Steam Cloud"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.ste